    "Tiers 11 and 12 take as long as tier 10, and no weapon in the game is slower than Slow (8).",
    "Two weapons with the same name can still attack at different speeds, which is why skill pages show the number beside the name: Fast (4) finishes an ordinary attack 30 ms before Fast (5)."
